  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Protection, Assistance et Solutions</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Internally Displaced Persons (IDPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding will provide financial support for a program aimed at reducing the sufferings of internally displaced persons (IDPS) and communities affected by crisis in the northwest (NW) and southwest (SW) regions of Cameroon through the provision of food, water, sanitation and hygiene, protection, shelter, nonfood items assistance and efficient humanitarian coordination.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La fourniture d&apos;une protection efficace, d&apos;une assistance et de solutions durables aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&apos;int&#xe9;rieur de leur propre pays (PDI) et aux autres victimes de conflits et de catastrophes.</narrative>
  </description>
